WEBVTT

NOTE
This is a short transition scene after the parade sequence. The scene shows Squall positioning himself for the assassination mission, establishing the sniper angle and target. Approximately 9 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Squall stands on a high rooftop in Deling City, near a chain-link fence. The evening sky is darkening, with city lights beginning to twinkle below. The parade float carrying Sorceress Edea is visible in the distance on the street below.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Squall surveys the area, eyes focused on the parade route. His hand rests on his gunblade. He nods slightly, confirming his position and readiness for the assassination attempt.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The camera pulls back to show the full scope of the rooftop position and the distant parade float below, the assassination mission's final preparations underway.
